{"schemaVersion":1,"courseNo":11,"lessonId":"sky/island-foundation/11-bigo","authored":true,"slides":[{"layout":"title","emoji":"⏱️","title":"計算量とオーダ","subtitle":"データが増えたとき、\nどれくらい遅くなるか。","blocks":[]},{"emoji":"🏠","title":"たとえ話","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"📚","real":"本が 10 冊→100 冊。\n探す時間が **どれくらい伸びるか**。","tech":"**時間計算量** = データ量 n で\n手間がどう増えるか。"}]},{"emoji":"🏷️","title":"O 記法（ビッグオー）","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**O( )** = 増え方の上限ラベル","sub":"細かい秒数より「型」を見る"}]},{"emoji":"1️⃣","title":"O(1)","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**O(1)** = いつも同じ時間","sub":"n が増えても手間は一定"}]},{"emoji":"📈","title":"O(n)","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**O(n)** = n に比例","sub":"データが 2 倍 → 手間も約 2 倍"}]},{"emoji":"🔍","title":"O(log n)","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"📖","real":"辞書を半分に折って探す。\n**一気に候補が減る**。","tech":"**O(log n)**。二分探索の典型。"}]},{"emoji":"🚀","title":"O(n log n)","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**O(n log n)** = 速いソートの目安","sub":"効率のよい並べ替えでよく出る"}]},{"emoji":"🐢","title":"O(n²)","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**O(n²)** = n×n くらい重い","sub":"二重ループ。バブルソートなど"}]},{"emoji":"🧱","title":"速い → 遅い","blocks":[{"t":"layers","top":"遅い","bottom":"速い","items":[{"icon":"🐢","label":"O(n²)"},{"icon":"🚀","label":"O(n log n)"},{"icon":"📈","label":"O(n)"},{"icon":"🔍","label":"O(log n)"},{"icon":"1️⃣","label":"O(1)"}]}]},{"emoji":"📝","title":"試験の型","blocks":[{"t":"callout","kind":"exam","text":"一定 → ==O(1)==。\n半分に切る探索 → O(log n)。"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認①","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"配列の先頭を読む計算量は？","choices":["O(n)","O(1)","O(n²)","O(log n)"],"answer":1,"explain":"場所が決まっている → ==O(1)==。","hint":"n に関係しない。"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認②","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"二重ループの目安は？","choices":["O(1)","O(n)","O(n²)","O(log n)"],"answer":2,"explain":"n×n → **O(n²)**。"}]},{"emoji":"🏁","title":"まとめ","blocks":[{"t":"bullets","items":["**O(1)** … 一定","**O(log n)** … 半分探索","**O(n²)** … 二重ループ"]}]}]}